              <p><strong class="text-[#f8fafc]">Who pushed back, and how it resolved:</strong> [TODO: a real disagreement between stakeholders/teams, and how you resolved it]</p>
              <p><strong class="text-[#f8fafc]">Business result:</strong> [TODO: an outcome in business terms — not ms/TPS/%, but cost, revenue, retention, risk avoided, or a regulator/exec satisfied]</p>
