            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 rounded-lg text-[#38bdf8] text-[11px] font-mono font-medium hover:bg-white/[0.07] transition-colors">Sub-50ms SLA</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 rounded-lg text-[#38bdf8] text-[11px] font-mono font-medium hover:bg-white/[0.07] transition-colors">Redis O(1) Idempotency</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 rounded-lg text-[#38bdf8] text-[11px] font-mono font-medium hover:bg-white/[0.07] transition-colors">ISO 8583 Bitmaps</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 rounded-lg text-[#38bdf8] text-[11px] font-mono font-medium hover:bg-white/[0.07] transition-colors">ScyllaDB Double-Entry</span>
