          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <span class="text-xs text-[#06b6d4] tracking-wider font-semibold uppercase font-mono">03 · Telecom Switching &amp; Queues</span>
            <div class="h-px flex-1 bg-white/10"></div>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#f8fafc] tracking-tight">National Telecom Routing &amp; Aggregator Infrastructure</h2>
          
          <!-- Invariant Box: Refined Badge -->
          <div class="mt-4 p-4 bg-[#0b1120]/70 border border-white/10 rounded-xl text-xs space-y-1.5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#06b6d4]"></span>
              <span class="text-[#06b6d4] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Architectural Invariant</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[#f8fafc] font-mono leading-relaxed">Zero OTP blockage during multi-million marketing broadcast surges. 1B+ SMS routed/year.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Mechanism -->
          <div class="text-[#94a3b8] text-xs sm:text-sm mt-3 space-y-2 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              Stateful SMPP 3.4 TCP sessions balanced over prefix bands (1000–9000). Dynamic sliding-window flow control (16–64 PDU) paired with upstream HLR lookups to filter dead numbers and Do-Not-Disturb (*800#) numbers before dispatch.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Failure Mode: Refined Badge -->
